pdated logic is ready for production?</li></ul><h3>Next Steps / Next Meeting</h3><p>Technopath will provide the requested estimate, visibility findings, and 2.4.7 upgrade proposal. Create Pharmacy will complete testing and review the materials once received. No follow-up meeting was scheduled; next steps can be coordinated after these items are available.</p><p>Please don\'t hesitate to reach out if anything needs clarification.</p><p>Best,</p><p>Technopath</p>','[{\"title\": \"Investigate product visibility requirements and identify any differentiators requiring separate configuration logic\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Jean Paul Hanna\", \"is_customer_facing\": false}, {\"title\": \"Send the revised 2.4.7 system upgrade proposal and documentation, including the reduced effort forecast\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Jean Paul Hanna\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}, {\"title\": \"Complete additional validation of the updated price-import logic and report the findings\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Romano\", \"is_customer_facing\": false}, {\"title\": \"Review the optimization estimate and upgrade proposal and provide feedback or approval\", \"due_date\": null, \"owner_name\": \"Create Pharmacy\", \"is_customer_facing\": true}]','\"Technopath will prepare an estimate and recommended action plan for the proposed pricing-performance optimization.\\nTechnopath will investigate whether product visibility requires distinct configuration logic.\\nTechnopath will send the revised 2.4.7 upgrade proposal reflecting an approximately 50-hour reduction in estimated effort.\\nCreate Pharmacy will complete additional validation of the updated price-import logic before providing approval to proceed.\"','\"What specific product visibility requirements or differentiators must be preserved in the proposed subgroup solution?\\nWhat is the final estimate and recommended implementation plan for the pricing-performance optimization?\\nWill additional price-i