\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}], \"needs_customer_input\": [], \"completed_since_last_meeting\": [{\"key\": \"TRAN-1297\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Cancel Nexcess subscription for staging\", \"updated\": \"2026-07-31T07:31:35.419-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}]}',NULL,'2026-08-05 19:36:14','kelly.a.hufford@gmail.com','[\"jp@technopath.co\", \"donia@technopath.co\"]',NULL,NULL,'openrouter','~anthropic/claude-fable-latest',NULL,'2026-08-05 19:33:22',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-05 19:33:22','2026-08-05 19:36:14'),(10,248,'CREAT','project = CREAT AND updated >= \'2026-07-31\' ORDER BY updated DESC','PROJECT: CreatePharmacy (Technopath) — Meeting Friday, August 7, 2026, 9:00 PM\n\nOVERALL HEALTH: Stable/Positive. 4 of 6 tracked items completed since last meeting, including all high/critical priority items. No blocked items, no items awaiting customer input. Main open risk is the active malware investigation (CREAT-976).\n\nCOMPLETED SINCE LAST MEETING (4):\n- CREAT-916 (Highest, Mostafa Naguib): Disabled/restricted publicly exposed GraphQL introspection — Shellproof security finding remediated. Done Aug 3.\n- CREAT-1063 (Medium, Nour eldin ayman): Applied Adobe Commerce Isolated Security Patch APSB26-73. Done Aug 3.\n- CREAT-1059 (High, Nour eldin ayman): Fixed reorder action failing with \"Required options weren\'t entered\" error. Done Aug 3.\n- CREAT-1064 (Critical, Mostafa Naguib): Fixed pricing hierarchy issue on Production — group price was being overridden by catalog price rule. Done Aug 1.\n\nIN PROGRESS (2):\n- CREAT-976 (Medium, Mostafa Naguib): Investigate and remediate malware issue. Last updated Aug 6 — most recently active ticket. Be prepared to give a status on findings, remediation steps, and hardening measures. RISK: sensitive topic; frame carefully with the client and emphasize the security work already completed (CREAT-916, CREAT-1063).\n- CREAT-1062 (Medium, Nour eldin ayman): Estimate for the proposed pricing-performance optimization plan. Confirm before the meeting whether the estimate is ready to present/send — this is a commercial opportunity and natural agenda item.\n\nBLOCKERS / RISKS:\n- No blocked or on-hold tickets in Jira.\n- Risk: malware remediation still open — confirm scope, root cause status, and ETA internally before the call.\n- Risk: pricing hierarchy issue was Critical and on Production — be ready to explain root cause and any verification/monitoring in place to prevent recurrence.\n\nNEEDS CUSTOMER INPUT: None flagged in Jira. However, the pricing-performance optimization estimate (CREAT-1062) will require customer review/approval once delivered — flag this as an upcoming decision point.\n\nKEY TALKING POINTS & RECOMMENDATIONS:\n1. Lead with strong delivery: all Critical/High/Highest items closed (security finding, security patch, reorder bug, production pricing fix).\n2. Provide a clear, confidence-building update on the malware investigation — what\'s been done, what remains, expected timeline. Align internally (JP, Nour, Donia) on messaging beforehand.\n3. Position the pricing-performance optimization estimate — confirm delivery date and walk through scope/value if ready.\n4. Confirm with the client that the pricing hierarchy fix is behaving correctly on Production from their side.\n5. Client/industry/platform fields are marked unknown in CRM context — platform is evidently Adobe Commerce (Magento) based on tickets; recommend updating client records. Client name per meeting title: CreatePharmacy.','Status Update Before Our Meeting – CreatePharmacy','<p>Hi Susan,</p><p>Ahead of our meeting on Friday, August 7, 2026, here\'s a quick summary of where things stand:</p><p><strong>Completed Since Last Meeting</strong></p><ul><li>Resolved a security finding from the recent security review by restricting publicly accessible technical information on the site.</li><li>Applied the latest official Adobe Commerce security patch to keep the platform protected and up to date.</li><li>Fixed the issue where reordering a previous purchase failed with a \"Required options weren\'t entered\" error.</li><li>Corrected the pricing issue on the live site where customer group pricing was being unintentionally overridden — group pricing is now applying correctly.</li></ul><p><strong>Currently In Progress</strong></p><ul><li>Ongoing security investigation and cleanup — our team is actively working through this and will share a full update during our meeting.</li><li>Preparing the estimate for the proposed pricing-performance optimization plan.</li></ul><p><strong>Blockers / Items Needing Your Input</strong></p><ul><li>Nothing is currently blocked on your side. Once the pricing-performance optimization estimate is ready, we\'ll need your review and approval to proceed.</li></ul><p><strong>Items Ready for Review</strong></p><ul><li>None at this time.</li></ul><p><strong>Proposed Agenda</strong></p><ol><li>Recap of completed work, including the recent pricing fix</li><li>Update on the ongoing security investigation</li><li>Pricing-performance optimization plan and next steps on the estimate</li><li>Open discussion, questions, and priorities for the coming period</li></ol><p>Please let us know if you\'d like to add anything to the agenda. Looking forward to speaking with you.</p><p>Best,</p>','Status Update Before Our Meeting – CreatePharmacy','<p>Hi Susan,</p><p>Ahead of our meeting on Friday, August 7, 2026, here\'s a quick summary of where things stand:</p><p><strong>Completed Since Last Meeting</strong></p><ul><li>Resolved a security finding from the recent security review by restricting publicly accessible technical information on the site.</li><li>Applied the latest official Adobe Commerce security patch to keep the platform protected and up to date.</li><li>Fixed the issue where reordering a previous purchase failed with a \"Required options weren\'t entered\" error.</li><li>Corrected the pricing issue on the live site where customer group pricing was being unintentionally overridden — group pricing is now applying correctly.</li></ul><p><strong>Currently In Progress</strong></p><ul><li>Ongoing security investigation and cleanup — our team is actively working through this and will share a full update during our meeting.</li><li>Preparing the estimate for the proposed pricing-performance optimization plan.</li></ul><p><strong>Blockers / Items Needing Your Input</strong></p><ul><li>Nothing is currently blocked on your side. Once the pricing-performance optimization estimate is ready, we\'ll need your review and approval to proceed.</li></ul><p><strong>Items Ready for Review</strong></p><ul><li>None at this time.</li></ul><p><strong>Proposed Agenda</strong></p><ol><li>Recap of completed work, including the recent pricing fix</li><li>Update on the ongoing security investigation</li><li>Pricing-performance optimization plan and next steps on the estimate</li><li>Open discussion, questions, and priorities for the coming period</li></ol><p>Please let us know if you\'d like to add anything to the agenda. Looking forward to speaking with you.</p><p>Best,</p>','\"1. Welcome & recap of items completed since last meeting — security patch, reorder fix, and production pricing correction (15 min)\\n2. Update on the ongoing security investigation and remediation — status, actions taken, and next steps (15–30 min)\\n3. Pricing-performance optimization plan — walkthrough of proposed scope and timeline for the estimate (15–30 min)\\n4. Client feedback, open questions, and confirmation of priorities and next steps (15 min)\"','{\"other\": [], \"in_progress\": [{\"key\": \"CREAT-976\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Investigate and Remediate Malware Issue\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-06T02:49:15.807-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"CREAT-1062\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Prepare and send an estimate for the proposed pricing-performance optimization plan\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-03T12:43:40.557-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}], \"snapshot_at\": \"2026-08-07T17:41:07.043393Z\", \"total_count\": 6, \"high_priority\": [{\"key\": \"CREAT-916\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Disable / restrict GraphQL introspection exposed publicly (Shellproof finding)\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-03T01:01:53.221-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"Highest\"}, {\"key\": \"CREAT-1059\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Reorder action fails with \\\"Required options weren\'t entered\\\" error\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-03T00:59:56.314-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"High\"}], \"ready_for_review\": [], \"recently_updated\": [{\"key\": \"CREAT-976\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Investigate and Remediate Malware Issue\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-06T02:49:15.807-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"CREAT-1062\", \"status\": \"In Progress\", \"summary\": \"Prepare and send an estimate for the proposed pricing-performance optimization plan\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-03T12:43:40.557-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"CREAT-916\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Disable / restrict GraphQL introspection exposed publicly (Shellproof finding)\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-03T01:01:53.221-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Mostafa Naguib\", \"priority\": \"Highest\"}, {\"key\": \"CREAT-1063\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Apply Adobe Commerce Isolated Security Patch APSB26-73\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-03T01:00:59.882-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"Medium\"}, {\"key\": \"CREAT-1059\", \"status\": \"Done\", \"summary\": \"Reorder action fails with \\\"Required options weren\'t entered\\\" error\", \"updated\": \"2026-08-03T00:59:56.314-0400\", \"assignee\": \"Nour eldin ayman\", \"priority\": \"High\"}, {\"key\": \"